                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff2fd65b-01d6-353a-b475-e90093f2c3ad",
                        "entry_id": "e8584a4f-1b64-31f1-ad55-13bed369cfec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A measure of varying quantity, often five or six (long or short) hundred, used especially when counting herring."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "dated",
                            "dialectal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7948c561-36f7-46fe-befd-3cb1509590cb",
                                "sense_id": "ff2fd65b-01d6-353a-b475-e90093f2c3ad",
                                "text": "a mease of herrings"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0644967e-c002-4cb4-932e-b5e693524747",
                                "sense_id": "ff2fd65b-01d6-353a-b475-e90093f2c3ad",
                                "text": "The weekly returns will show a great falling off in the herring fishing which it may be said was a complete failure—and consequently caused a falling off of the revenues of the Harbour. There were only 521 mease of herrings sold at an average price of £1 2s 7¾d., or total £590."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24ba8d27-6c19-4b10-825d-e77509b355aa",
                                "sense_id": "ff2fd65b-01d6-353a-b475-e90093f2c3ad",
                                "text": "During the past few days large quantities of herrings have been caught at Clovelly. One fisherman, James Small, brought in about twenty mease (mease, 600). The prices realised have fallen so low as 5s. per mease."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0f965bb-15ea-4206-bb50-7278bf0986b8",
                                "sense_id": "ff2fd65b-01d6-353a-b475-e90093f2c3ad",
                                "text": "At Portavogie a few mease of herring were landed in June by some twenty-five boats."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "ffccbedd-fcf1-3a22-87c2-919582d4169a",
